    {
      "source": "@log/「獣に変えられた王子の童話をしっているかしら？」",
      "source_ja": "「獣に変えられた王子の童話をしっているかしら？」",
      "target": "“짐승으로 변한 왕자 이야기를 아세요?”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:561492",
        "2.335:start.hsp:561500"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "source": "@log/The stunning beauty of Elea's face halts your step a moment.",
      "source_ja": "痺れるほど美しいエレアの横顔にあなたは見とれた。",
      "target": "당신은 엘레아의 눈부신 옆모습에 넋을 잃었다.",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:561492",
        "2.335:start.hsp:561500"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "source": "@log/\"The world is thrown into bedlam and chaos. We must remain strong in the face of it.\"",
      "source_ja": "「この世界は今、大きく変わろうとしているの」",
      "target": "“지금 이 세계는 크게 달라지려 하고 있어요.”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:561492",
        "2.335:start.hsp:561500"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "source": "@log/\"The man we saw in Vernis, he just might be...\"",
      "source_ja": "「ヴェルニースで見かけたあの男…まさか…」",
      "target": "“베르니스에서 본 그 남자… 설마…”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:561492",
        "2.335:start.hsp:561500"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "source": "@log/Someone mutters in mysterious ancient language.",
      "source_ja": "神秘的な古代の言葉で誰かが囁いた。",
      "target": "누군가 신비로운 고대어로 속삭였다.",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:561492",
        "2.335:start.hsp:561500"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
      "source": "@log/\"Eleas is already being regarded as a heretic, your lofty dignity isn't helping this.\"",
      "source_ja": "「あなたはプライドが高すぎるのよ。ただでさえエレアは異端視されているのに」",
      "target": "“당신은 자존심이 너무 강해요. 그렇잖아도 다들 엘레아를 이단으로 여기는데…”",
      "source_ref": [
        "2.335:start.hsp:561492",
        "2.335:start.hsp:561500"
      ],
      "review_status": "reviewed"
    },
